# ============================================
# AutoML Agent - Environment Configuration
# ============================================
#
# IMPORTANT: This file is OPTIONAL!
#
# - NO .env file: System uses Ollama (local LLM, free, no setup)
# - WITH .env: You can configure OpenAI or Azure OpenAI
#
# The system auto-detects available credentials:
#   1. Azure OpenAI (if both AZURE variables set)
#   2. OpenAI (if OPENAI_API_KEY set)
#   3. Ollama (fallback, always works)
#
# To use this file:
#   1. Copy: cp .env.example .env
#   2. Uncomment and fill the values you need
#   3. Restart docker-compose
# ============================================

# Option 1: Standard OpenAI
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Option 2: Azure OpenAI
# AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_azure_api_key_here

# Optional: Logfire (for LLM observability and token tracking)
# Get free token from https://logfire.pydantic.dev
# LOGFIRE_TOKEN=your_logfire_token_here
